OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to reopen theatre overcome
OL,4,Amajor hurdle
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to remove and replace a Surrey
OL,7,Ftheatre's roof are due to be considered
OL,8,Fto help reopen the venue.
OL,10,FRedhill's popular Harlequin Theatre
OL,11,Fclosed in 2023 after it was discovered
OL,12,Fthat unsafe crumbly RAAC concrete
OL,13,Flining the building could collapse
OL,14,Fwithout warning.
OL,16,FThe site has remained closed since with
OL,17,Fdelays and rising costs pushing back
OL,18,Fits scheduled reopening date.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
