OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to reopen theatre overcome
OL,4,Amajor hurdle
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,7,FService (LDRS) reports a major hurdle
OL,8,Fnow looks set to be overcome as Reigate
OL,9,Fand Banstead Borough Council's planning
OL,10,Fcommittee has been recommended to
OL,11,Fapprove sorting out the roof.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
